My Life is a drama, romance film directed by Bruce Joel Rubin.

3
00:20:07,058 --> 00:20:13,058
It seems that Bob Jones has everything a man could want, namely a
fulfilling job and a beautiful, pregnant wife, Gail.

4
00:26:49,411 --> 00:26:55,411
But Bob's life is turned upside-down when he is diagnosed with cancer and given four
months to live -- not even enough time to see his first child's birth.

5
00:33:31,764 --> 00:33:37,764
To cleanse himself of demons in his remaining days, Bob makes a video
diary, hoping to pass along some wisdom to his future child.

6
00:40:14,117 --> 00:40:20,117
Along the way, he discovers a lot about himself.

